15 Smart Recipe Planner

## Overview

Develop an intelligent recipe recommendation system based on available ingredients, dietary preferences, budget, and user preferences.

## Core Features

* Ingredient input
* Recipe database
* Search
* Dietary preferences
* Recipe recommendations
* Shopping list
* Budget estimation

## Possible Extensions

* Personalized recommendations
* Ingredient substitution
* Nutrition analysis
* Food waste reduction
* AI-generated recipes

## Suggested Difficulty

Intermediate / Advanced
